        "F4"
      ],
      "plan": "To foster a nuanced discussion about local LLM performance metrics. The post will present hypothetical speed figures and immediately qualify them with the unmeasured aspects (TTFT, quality), emphasizing that the hypothetical results are not definitive. It aims to gather community input on what constitutes 'good' performance in practice."
    }
  ]
